message: "If you use this software in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "NoisePQC++: A C++23 Implementation of the Noise Protocol Framework with Post-Quantum Cryptography"
version: "0.9.0"
date-released: 2026-04-25
authors:
  - family-names: Ahmed
    given-names: Nadeem
url: "https://github.com/nata11/NoisePQCpp"
