license: "Apache-2.0"
license-url: "https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0"
keywords:
  - cryptography
  - noise protocol
  - post-quantum cryptography
  - C++23
  - secure communications
  - key exchange
  - AEAD
  - PQC
  - ML-KEM
  - ChaCha20-Poly1305
abstract: >
  NoisePQC++ is a modern, type-safe implementation of the Noise Protocol
  Framework using C++23 modules with support for post-quantum cryptography
  and hybrid forward secrecy. The library provides cryptographic protocol
  building blocks including AEAD ciphers, hash functions, Diffie-Hellman key
  exchange, and NIST-standardized ML-KEM for quantum-resistant key
  encapsulation.
